{"id":1750,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>6月29日至30日，中国工程教育专业认证专家组一行五人莅临我校，开展特种能源技术与工程专业工程教育认证现场考查，专家组由西安工业大学李静教授担任组长。副校长尹建平，教务部、人力资源部、学生工作部、招生与就业工作、国有资产部、创新创业学院等职能部门负责人，学院班子成员和专业教师全程参加本次认证活动。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=ALm61Ro7nRnmMRMmmLDoz62MR-8n77NsUm62LzARM8-ZU8U0gihFp2hmCIa0LkyZnkyPUYhVL4GbU4TknRl4L8-snRWfnRvaolM2nm6RL4rFnlnVUz9iLRWFMRU8U4LJv2bjo4OeoDA/_IVPgDTJQty0LzGsMYyPLzvYM1bw62T8c&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11726&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/08D1CE309C9BD533B7D2AD709CFF7C35/EDEA8502/444C3\" vheight=\"369\" vwidth=\"553\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=AozC1aU8lbM49DLmmUiLmUPo7-sMzTNRU8WkMlnknNCDMml0gihFp2hmCIa0MkyanShVLYhfnmrkM7nRU4lDMzQRLlr2MRAfMmW2U8-YLRnFLlnkU8WkL7MFL4VVozM2gjfJQ4Oeo4xwqjTAvShXptQ0g47aM4v0Lz7sLmCJqdTnx&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11726&e=.png\"></p><p>现场考查期间，专家组紧扣认证标准，通过听取专业建设汇报、实验室与实践基地实地走访、职能部门及专业师生深度座谈、人才培养档案资料核查等多项工作，全方位、多维度对专业办学条件与育人质量开展对标研判。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=AUzT1knz-ZUzlaLm8QfL4f2L4r7M7nNknRlDnRfRM7MRUN70gihFp2hmCIa0LSy4MYyZokh2U46ko7V2UlrVM4WRMNlbU8L8Lz-8UmvYnRAFLl-4nzrfL7QFnRGYMSbaptveo4Oeq2XbC570qIbtpYyPLRvsg47PM4-DgtA8pUTcc&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11726&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/13788FC7B8AFAEE72C6E9CC4124B72D8/1B3E5A0F/D025\" vheight=\"162\" vwidth=\"243\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=AozN1soz67UzvaUmmMRMzlDLl-4Lm6NfLlliMNL4LR7inz70gihFp2hmCIa0oShVMSy4LSyPnz-YnzvsnmlaUzUZMRQ2nNVkn7CDMNC8MmQFUNVfUlQ2LmWFol7PnlLJv2bjo4OeoDA/_IVPgDTJQty0LzGsMYyPLzvYM1bw62T8c&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11726&e=.png\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=AUzr1RL4MRU4-DLm4V2L4NYolr2L4rN2ozn7L4Wfo7Q7nmN0gihFp2hmCIa0nky8LYyiUShRMmNDU4NsMlMVLm-4n7Q2Ml78MlWVU47sUNrFnlLsLmLiMmrFnlLsUSbaptveo4Oeq2XbC570qIbtpYyPLRvsg47PM4-DgtA8pUTcc&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11726&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/D435AC696C975CE223DFF5A45BEC17BE/EC723565/EC7A\" vheight=\"163\" vwidth=\"245\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=AUNQ1VU8lPMzvZUmNCaozf7MNUaM7-NDUzQVo7L8Lm7bozG0gihFp2hmCIa0U1h2LYybMkyZM7LPUl7ZMzWRMNMRnRN8nzA7MmnVMNLboR6FUmNbn7LaMRnFolUYMl-Jv2bjo4OeoDA/_IVPgDTJQty0LzGsMYyPLzvYM1bw62T8c&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11726&e=.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=AMz714MmAVUmV2LmNWkLz-PnN7ZL7CNsnlCsL7-soRf2MmU0gihFp2hmCIa0nky4LkyDnkyYnzMRLl-8nNW7L8Q2olV7U8CinNCYLlnkoRVFnmlYUlLbLNMFLzV7U4lJv2bjo4OeoDA/_IVPgDTJQty0LzGsMYyPLzvYM1bw62T8c&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11726&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/D306D2E3C1B4FBD3FF9ADCF5FF21DB81/F52AC92C/11DC5\" vheight=\"161\" vwidth=\"241\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Aoll1bUz7inm7ZMmmvYnmNsLmM7MzCN8nmvZM49YolMRUm70gihFp2hmCIa0M1h2oSyDLYhko7CZLNQ7MRlDLlQ2Uz9sLNWfMzCsM4CaM8MFo7QkL4NDozAFoz94oz7Jv2bjo4OeoDA/_IVPgDTJQty0LzGsMYyPLzvYM1bw62T8c&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11726&e=.png\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=ALlW1kn7UaUzU4nmmMkUzV7ollPolCNPL4-4M7lYM4UsUm90gihFp2hmCIa0okyiokhfn1hkU8nfU4MVoRV2nmW2MzV2oRQVoRT7oRAkMRAFLmVRMNl4nlMFLzVfnRGJv2bjo4OeoDA/_IVPgDTJQty0LzGsMYyPLzvYM1bw62T8c&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11726&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/858AFBCDAC3E81FF2F51F86E89D88B48/21C6E3EC/11AD0\" vheight=\"162\" vwidth=\"246\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=ALlW17nmrkozvaUm4C4M7LZUl7snllN8M4GaMmM2MRU4Mmv0gihFp2hmCIa0LkhRL1hkMYhfolQkL7-aL4A2U8nVMmvDozGbLmviMmrVLRfFM462L47YUzTFolLaMz9Jv2bjo4OeoDA/_IVPgDTJQty0LzGsMYyPLzvYM1bw62T8c&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11726&e=.png\"></p><p>在专家反馈会上，专家组充分认可我校特种能源技术与工程专业在学科建设、师资队伍、实践教学、人才培养方案落地等方面取得的建设成效。同时专家组客观指出专业现存短板，重点围绕毕业要求支撑矩阵优化、课程体系顶层设计等方面提出针对性整改与持续改进意见。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=AUN71YnmT2Uzf7nmzM2LmG4UzCZMlWNVL4CDMzT7oRvsL4v0gihFp2hmCIa0MSyiUSy4okhVLmnkUzGPnNr2LzUbnlV7MzQRnzLDnNWVUmWFM4ffMRG4nmMFMR6fLmLJv2bjo4OeoDA/_IVPgDTJQty0LzGsMYyPLzvYM1bw62T8c&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11726&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/55A38E24BA01FEF149EAD56CE36FBEB2/70A403F3/47A23\" vheight=\"369\" vwidth=\"553\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=AMRQ1RoRCZLNV7omRvaoz-PLm7iLzUNDLzLsMmTkMzv4UNl0gihFp2hmCIa0nShRMYyDoky4U8lYMm-DLN7YMl-ioRLYUm67L7UZUNQVL7nFL7rfLl-iU8WFL4VVozM2gjfJQ4Oeo4xwqjTAvShXptQ0g47aM4v0Lz7sLmCJqdTnx&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11726&e=.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=AL4C1iL4n2MznfLmlM7L8lPnml4ozfN7Ml-8UmLZL7MfLRN0gihFp2hmCIa0MYysU1hVLYhkoRGiMm78Uz-iLzvDnl7iLlUsnlLZn7-iUlWFM4WfMmlZnmnFMzLaLl7Jv2bjo4OeoDA/_IVPgDTJQty0LzGsMYyPLzvYM1bw62T8c&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11726&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/77BE3B805614A25176EA51D7EC8DB5AB/72A658F4/5301A\" vheight=\"415\" vwidth=\"553\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=AM7-1DnlCiM4GYMmm9bL7-iLm74nmlN8oRUbM87Do7n7Mll0gihFp2hmCIa0MYybMkybokhkUNlaLzf2MmWkoRvsLN7Poz74nRUZLl-PLmrFMNWkLNnVo7WFL49YLmf2gjfJQ4Oeo4xwqjTAvShXptQ0g47aM4v0Lz7sLmCJqdTnx&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11726&e=.png\"></p><p>副校长尹建平代表学校作表态发言，表示学校完全认可、全盘接纳专家组各项反馈意见，严格遵循工程教育核心理念，压紧压实整改责任，不折不扣抓好后续整改提升工作，确保问题闭环清零。同时表示，学校将系统总结本次现场考查工作经验，全面践行工程教育先进育人理念，持续深化本科教育教学改革，创新工程人才培养模式，统筹优化办学资源配置，深耕专业内涵建设，全面提升专业办学综合实力，稳步提高工程类人才培养质量。</p><p><br></p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://hjaq.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=ALm61Ro7nRnmMRMmmLDoz62MR-8n77NsUm62LzARM8-ZU8U0gihFp2hmCIa0LkyZnkyPUYhVL4GbU4TknRl4L8-snRWfnRvaolM2nm6RL4rFnlnVUz9iLRWFMRU8U4LJv2bjo4OeoDA/_IVPgDTJQty0LzGsMYyPLzvYM1bw62T8c&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11726&e=.png"}